-| Tax and shipping are correct at and around the threshold | Met | Threshold cases at 49.99, 50.00 and 50.01 in both test suites |
-| Cart survives a refresh | Met | `cartStorage.test`, `App.test` restore, headless-browser reload |
-| Invalid stored state and upstream errors are handled | Met | `cartStorage.test`, `FakeStoreClientTests`, `App.test` error and retry |
-| Checkout verifies prices and quantities on the backend | Met | `CheckoutServiceTests`, `CheckoutRequestValidatorTests` |
-| Success confirms the order and clears the cart | Met | `CheckoutDialog.test` |
-| Failure preserves the cart and allows recovery | Met | `CheckoutDialog.test`: network retry, 409, 422 |
